    "agendaChanges": "Items 10.5 (Approval of E-Rate Bid Process for WAN Service) and 10.6 (Approval of E-Rate Bid for Bundled Internet Access) were pulled from the Consent Calendar and moved to Action Items, to be taken up after Action Item 11.1. The formal agenda listed a Welcome by Vice President Mike Wells under Section 5, but Wells himself presided and delivered the welcome as acting president. Closed Session report was deferred to after the meeting (no decisions made). Items were taken in the following order: Roll Call, Reconvene/Report Out on Closed Session, Welcome (Section 5), Changes to Agenda (Section 6), Approval of Agenda (Section 7), Oral Communication (Section 8), School/Community Reports 9.1 (Section 9), Consent Items minus 10.5 and 10.6 (Section 10), Action Item 11.1 (Section 11), Action Item 10.5 (pulled), Action Item 10.6 (pulled), Board and Superintendent Reports (Section 12), Correspondence (Section 13), Other Business (Section 14), Board Meetings Calendar (Section 15), Adjournment (Section 16).",
